    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp01_select_01",
      "hash64": "D4717B8263D1451D",
      "text": "是啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp01_select_02",
      "hash64": "D471788263D14004",
      "text": "嗯……？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "743CA20901C56D68",
      "text": "真是個老實的好孩子！\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳挺可愛的嘛。[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp01_03b",
      "hash64": "48745F4E027847FE",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳就不肯配合一下啊～！\\n哪！哈！哈！讓我都忍不住吐槽了。[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "743CA90901C5794D",
      "text": "怎麼？只要讓這個學園\\n整個熱鬧起來就行了是吧？[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "743CA80901C5779A",
      "text": "那是我拿手的事嘛。\\n就交給辛俐姐姐我吧～！[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "78B3E31FD517400E",
      "text": "之前我來這個學園，\\n其實是當大將她的保母啦。[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "78B3E41FD51741C1",
      "text": "那個人看起來很完美，\\n但其實挺少根筋的。\\r\\n辛俐姐姐我不好好看著她可不行。[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "416A704DF61BF9C0",
      "text": "真意外！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "416A734DF61BFED9",
      "text": "妳們是好搭檔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "78B3E11FD5173CA8",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳想想，那時候她也忘了要把\\n那奇怪的光碟交給那個叫白蕾雅的人啊！[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp02_02b",
      "hash64": "30E45317167C4B3E",
      "text": "就是說啊！說起來，\\n我們也是有很久的交情了。[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "78B3E21FD5173E5B",
      "text": "偶～爾還會看到她工作時，\\n頭髮上就纏著晶光芽呢。[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "78B3E71FD51746DA",
      "text": "……啊，這件事\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳不能跟大將說喲。\\r\\n我會被她教訓的。[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "78B3E81FD517488D",
      "text": "這是辛俐姐姐我和[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳\\n兩個人之間的秘密喲？[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "770B991AADACD51F",
      "text": "教學生各式各樣的事雖然很有趣，\\n但要花腦筋，可真辛苦啊～[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "770B981AADACD36C",
      "text": "辛俐姐姐我工作的時候，\\n是會切換到正經模式的。[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "770B9B1AADACD885",
      "text": "我會帥氣地戴上眼鏡，\\n不過鏡片沒有度數就是了！[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "770B9A1AADACD6D2",
      "text": "話說回來，[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳已經在面試的時候\\n看過正經的辛俐姐姐了嘛。[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
