    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp03_05",
      "hash64": "770B941AADACCCA0",
      "text": "哦～這樣嗎！？\\n既然這樣，我和[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳在一起的時候……\\c\\n我就呼～地放鬆下來，\\n放心做自己了喲～[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp03_05b",
      "hash64": "F5796B551C9FEDA6",
      "text": "哦～這樣嗎！？\\n既然如此，和您在一起的時候，\\r\\n我就以誠懇有禮的態度與您相處如何呢？\\r\\n……我開玩笑的啦！[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
